    "description": "Self-indicating electronic indicators, mains or DC-powered, designed to be used as part of Class III or IIII non-automatic weighing instruments. Desktop and wall-mounted versions with 5.7\" graphic LCD display, A/D conversion module (up to 2) and main board with processor. Devices include initial/semi-automatic/automatic zero setting, zero tracking, semi-automatic subtractive tare, preset tare, MPP Alibi storage device, up to 2 load receptors with summation, weighbridge modes (AdR/RDA, RcD, RpD/RCP), identification of weighing boards, digital load cells and DILINK junction box, and encrypted weight data transmission per Welmec 7.2. Interfaces: 6-wire shielded load cell connection, RS232/422/485, Ethernet, Wi-Fi, 0-10 V / 0-20 mA analogue I/O, digital I/O, field bus (Profibus), USB host, SD card, audio. Any compatible load cell with a valid R60 OIML Certificate of Conformity may be used; load cells marked NH are allowed only if humidity testing to R76 has been conducted."
